    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Steps to follow</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Input Fields</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Output Screens</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">1</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Product Support team needs to have manage fi=
rm and user role assigned&nbsp; under NBIN in order to create a new system =
health event</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">na</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">na</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Access the Features module and identify the feature for which event=
 needs to be created.</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7ecd7d58-9c05-4392-8bed-0a875bf1b6ac">Read descripti=
on to ensure the right feature has been identified.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"785a071b-f7a8-404b-82b9-0f1fff2768f0">Validate if re=
source field is present for the feature or not.</li>
     </ul>
     <p><em>=E2=86=92 Manage Firm =E2=86=92 Features</em></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><br></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><br></p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">2</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Access System Health Events module</p>
     <p><em>=E2=86=92 Manage Firm =E2=86=92 System Health Events</em></p></=
td>
