   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">4</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>For Incident complete all fields and Start Event</p>
     <p><em>=E2=86=92 Manage Firm =E2=86=92 System Health Events =E2=86=92 =
