     <p><br></p>
     <p>For Planned Maintenance complete all fields and Start Event</p>
     <p><em>=E2=86=92 Manage Firm =E2=86=92 System Health Events =E2=86=92 =
New Event =E2=86=92 Planned Maintenance=E2=86=92 Start Event</em></p>
     <p><br></p>
     <p>Once events are started they are available on thee System Health Ev=
ents list</p></td>
