 height=3D"164"></span></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>na</p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">5</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>After event is created:</p>
     <p><strong>For Incidents:&nbsp;</strong> The event gets updated on the=
 Status Page &amp; Health Events List <u><strong>immediately</strong></u> i=
rrespective of whether the event is scheduled or not</p>
     <p><strong>For Planned Maintenance:</strong> The event gets updated on=
 the Status Page, the Maintenance Banner&nbsp; &amp; Health Event List<u><s=
trong> immediately</strong></u> irrespective of whether the event is schedu=
led or not.</p>
     <p>Steps 5.1 to 5.6 need to be completed for event creation.</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><br></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><br></p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">5.1</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Feature</strong>:</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"64830626-4493-44ca-b0d7-7e1e7d79a98f">Select feature=
 from drop down or alternatively start typing the feature name to search.</=
li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"4cbe4e21-d487-417c-8733-31a99ee6a723">Free text is n=
ot allowed and only features available in drop down can be selected.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"00dd6192-d191-4922-b334-b52287e36b16"><strong>For In=
cidents:</strong>&nbsp; The Feature name is displayed on status page and al=
l incidents for the same feature are grouped together for all CX users.</li=
>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e7c3ee6d-a8f3-4bab-b9dc-5e9f3b5124b1"><strong>For Pl=
anned Maintenance:</strong> The feature name is for internal tracking and i=
s not displayed on the banner or status page for CX users.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"5a2d5ff2-79e2-4f05-bb11-f2ae95f76709">The complete l=
ist of features can be accessed through the Feature module</li>
     </ul>
     <p><em>=E2=86=92 Manage Firm =E2=86=92 Features</em></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
