   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">5.2</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Feature Health</strong>: Product Support team can select fr=
om two options available from drop down.</p>
     <p><strong>Degraded Performance: </strong>Incident impacts only some a=
ccounts or some users or some clients</p>
     <p><strong>Outage: </strong>Event impacts all users or all accounts or=
 users or clients using the feature.</p>
     <p>For Incidents: The health category is displayed on the status page<=
/p>
     <p>For Planned Maintenance: The health category is only displayed on t=
his list and not on the status page</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedde=
d-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail=
