      <li data-uuid=3D"9f01c450-6e3e-4bdd-b3db-991338ee8e1e">Event message =
could have the impacts, workarounds and details of expected resolution.</li=
>
      <li data-uuid=3D"40a3db65-c2ec-4621-9d74-af9f0ec31e05"><strong>For In=
cidents:</strong> The Event Message will be displayed to CX users on the st=
atus page</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1b795f9e-f4ce-43cd-9588-17b3ef23e6e5"><strong>For Pl=
anned Maintenance:</strong> The Event Message will be displayed to CX users=
