   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">5.5</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Schedule Event:&nbsp;</strong></p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"11f0df91-c710-4bf9-89ed-c0d397f77c2c">The Start Date=
 and End Date are displayed to the CX users on the status page.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ecc98ca4-453d-42c2-9b0e-3be25a40e19e">Start Date &am=
p; Time =E2=86=92 Impacts the&nbsp; date displayed against the event on the=
 Start Page</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"19d332f2-c409-4d23-89e4-79ae2658ee5e">End Date &amp;=
 Time &nbsp;=E2=86=92 Impacts the end date displayed on the status page. On=
ce the end date is reached the banners ends or gets dismissed automatically=
</li>
     </ul>
     <p><strong>For Incidents: (Not Mandatory)</strong></p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"12737b97-d1ec-4a02-9ab4-05b6be7b4217">If checkbox is=
 selected then only Start Date can be modified.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"f2ce531a-8c33-4f88-93d7-5323679af1a1">If checkbox is=
 not selected then Start Date will be same as when the user manually create=
d the event.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"169d5338-0dba-4b37-b9f1-d42ce52441dc">Scenario1: If =
an incident has been identified on the same day/time as it occurred=20
       <ul>
        <li data-uuid=3D"91ba6bf4-c2cf-45cb-b0fe-5cd0c1746122">The schedule=
d event&nbsp; option should NOT be used.&nbsp;</li>
       </ul></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"3afe7843-df1e-48d3-9f00-13088cf88896">Scenario2 : If=
 user decided to select a future date=20
       <ul>
        <li data-uuid=3D"ebc748a3-5398-4c7d-a3b2-b204a11e7dec">The is not a=
 valid scenario and future dates should not be selected as the incident wil=
l appear on the status page immediately after creation.</li>
       </ul></li>
     </ul>
     <p><strong>For Planned Maintenance: (Mandatory)</strong></p>
     <ul>
      <li>Both Start and End date needs to be updated.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e486ecd7-4cc0-4c41-8b90-233bcaba66cf">Scenario1: Pla=
nned maintenance period is already known=20
       <ul>
        <li data-uuid=3D"c09059c1-5a20-4af8-b404-c632bd87c458">Select the s=
tart date and end date as it will reduce the number of steps</li>
       </ul></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"77dfd819-6ad4-4ba7-af5a-358d2d8b328a">Scenario2: If =
only Start date is known=20
       <ul>
        <li data-uuid=3D"fff78a10-fa19-4644-b8af-fdc0afaaf332">Select end d=
ate well into the future so that it can be updated later.</li>
       </ul></li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>For Incidents</p>
