   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">5.6</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>&nbsp;Target Audience:</strong></p>
     <ul>
      <li>Optional and can be selected using the checkbox.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"9609d8e4-a4c0-4228-be43-d7f4a85bda47">If checkbox is=
 not selected the event will be visible to all users</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8b8e06e5-c6af-4f49-a5ae-9a9ff9e9c5f3">Users can sele=
ct only 1 of the target groups&nbsp; - Feature Access, Firms or User Roles.=
</li>
     </ul>
     <p><strong>If Feature Access targeting is selected :</strong></p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8cc2c98a-7b20-4566-ae7c-1836a281fb4e">Check if resou=
rce field is available for the feature.&nbsp;</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"75acdd06-baaa-4bc6-b4bb-52087e1583b3">Scenario 1: If=
 resource field is not updated then DO NOT select feature access else&nbsp;=
<u><strong>NO</strong></u> users will view the event</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7ecb2302-dcd3-45c2-99a0-4f8e1cd764fe">Scenario 2: If=
 resource field is updated then only users with access to the feature will =
be able to view the event</li>
     </ul>
     <p><strong>If Firm targeting is selected:</strong></p>
     <ul>
      <li>Further select the firm scope - Firm Type or Specific Firms</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a6908511-6516-4833-ac72-a22e5fe915eb">Scenario 1:=20
       <ul>
        <li data-uuid=3D"309a8007-8aeb-4f74-8fa5-c4fd64694f72">Only one of =
the firm types can be selected and currently no option to select multiple f=
irm types - PM, IB, IFM, Others.</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"30759ce9-1303-4683-b70e-6e1e39e1234e">If any of th=
e firm type is selected then NBIN and COR are added by default.</li>
       </ul></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"5e388801-224d-4324-b158-fbe5eae42d0a">Scenario 2:=20
       <ul>
        <li data-uuid=3D"c5c7512a-da23-4d89-ada1-c7cf14906e5f">If specific =
firms is selected then users can add multiple firms from the selector.</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"a38e54a6-1e40-4051-9e19-73a7a1005391">Note - NBIN =
and COR have to be manually added.</li>
       </ul></li>
     </ul>
     <p><strong>If Role targeting is selected:</strong></p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a86378db-8d23-45d9-8eae-d654032e97a5">Select one or =
multiple number of roles that the targeted events need to be displayed to.<=
/li>
     </ul>
     <p><br></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><br></p>
      <p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedde=
d-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail=
