<h1 id=3D"ApplicationStatusOperationalization-Newincident/schedulemaintenan=
ceresolution">New incident/schedule maintenance resolution</h1>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped relative-table confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 98=
.4876%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 4.35036%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 51.5625%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 21.1813%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 22.8996%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">No</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Steps to follow</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Input Fields</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Output Screens</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">1</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Access System Health Events module and identify the event that need=
s to be resolved using Search, Filter or Sort&nbsp;</p>
     <p><em>=E2=86=92 Manage Firm =E2=86=92 System Health Events</em></p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"517e51a6-fab6-4be2-9935-c6971110f058">
       <p>The default filter view will show all active incidents and planne=
d maintenance and events which have ended on the previous day. T<span style=
=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">o view event history user need to use Filter op=
tions - Start Date, End date, Last Updated, Feature Health</span></p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"600ae63d-eda0-482d-b9bb-4bb8bcf55bf4">
       <p>Search basis Feature, Event title or event message can be used to=
 drill down into the events visible on the list</p></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"117f88d8-ad25-4ce3-b2ac-cddb211e6468">Event creation=
 date &amp;&nbsp; last updated by user can be see in the event menu</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedde=
d-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail=
 confluence-external-resource" draggable=3D"false" width=3D"205" src=3D"htt=
ps://wiki.bnc.ca/download/attachments/2738247840/image-2026-5-27_13-12-59.p=
ng?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1779901979545&amp;api=3Dv2" data-imag=
e-src=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/download/attachments/2738247840/image-2026-5-2=
7_13-12-59.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1779901979545&amp;api=3Dv=
2"></span></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">2</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>For Incidents:</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ba6ae791-ea99-41af-a906-980f1a833eb0"><strong>Scenar=
io 1 - </strong><em><strong>Incident is resolved: </strong></em>Click on En=
d Event to resolve the incident. When the event is ended the status of even=
t is reverted to Operational.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"2e2b0857-510d-4e41-ac6a-839bb7ec2dac"><strong>Scenar=
io 2 -</strong>&nbsp;<em><strong>Incident is resolved and additional info n=
eeds to be shared with clients:</strong></em> If there is any updates to th=
e message required then edit the message and click on update. After updates=
 are completed only then click on End Event (Note: If Update Event is not u=
sed&nbsp; before End Event then updates made to the event description etc. =
will not be saved and event will end)</li>
     </ul>
     <p>For Planned Maintenance:</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e720e351-ecad-4935-8432-289e54b377b9">Once the event=
 ends users will not see the planned maintenance banner.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"94cb51fa-8e80-4f1e-b1d4-6a314f028cf1"><strong>Scenar=
io 1 -&nbsp;<em>No change in planned schedule</em></strong><em>:</em>&nbsp;=
 The event is resolved automatically based on the end date defined.&nbsp;</=
li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ec285e3b-7875-43ed-befb-8fe404ac7dd3"><strong>Scenar=
io2&nbsp; - <em>If the planned event has ended before the scheduled end tim=
e:</em></strong>&nbsp; Use end event</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedde=
d-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail=
" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"345" src=3D"03746caa88d64889e4b69f6609371a3=
