<h1 id=3D"ApplicationStatusOperationalization-Updatestoactiveevents">Update=
s to active events</h1>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped relative-table confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 76=
.1646%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 5.62675%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 67.0598%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 27.3053%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">No</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Steps to follow</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">1.</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>All event details can be updated if event is active or not ended.</=
p>
     <p>Select the event to be edited from the event list: <em>=E2=86=92 Ma=
nage Firm =E2=86=92 System Health Events</em></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><br></p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: center;" class=3D"confluenceTd">2</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Scenario1: Based on additional information the event details need t=
o be updated</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"c2c66747-183f-4e3d-970d-8163ea6cec83">Select the eve=
nt and update required details</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ddabb6c5-09d5-458f-95ed-f37f40e43e94">Click on Updat=
e event and revised details will be updated on the status page and banner</=
li>
     </ul>
     <p><br></p>
     <p>Scenario2: Event created in error and not needed.</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"39517d48-f9d0-4c37-b4ec-67e1ae2d9339">Select the eve=
nt and delete</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"25b756d1-17db-4025-9025-41fb057eb642">Event details =
will be removed from the event list and status page</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedde=
d-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail=
" draggable=3D"false" width=3D"238" src=3D"a46e790fd7b1b76e0126659c5334138b=
