<h1 id=3D"ApplicationStatusOperationalization-Updatestoclosedevents">Update=
s to closed events</h1>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"def83b4a-0193-415c-b1ed-9c18effee240">Updates to closed e=
vents should ideally be avoided and updated only in case of errors.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"3dab0199-c46f-4fbd-bf4e-a313a2bb299a">Select closed incid=
ent or planned maintenance and edit message, then click on update.</li>
</ul>
