ify existing feature, first select the feature from the list and then use U=
pdate Feature</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"46ad9d19-3f61-45d7-b9cc-76b0b48d7559">To delete exis=
ting feature, first select feature from the list and then use Delete Featur=
e&nbsp;</li>
